* Write a Java program that uses reflection to inspect a class's declared methods, fields, and constructors.
* Write a Java program that dynamically creates proxy instances and design a test to monitor class-loading counts.
* Write a Java program that repeatedly loads classes through disposable class loaders and tracks loaded and unloaded class counts.
